<title>HONG KONG: Applied Intl, RJP suspended.</title>
<headline>Applied Intl, RJP suspended.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-05-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading in shares of Applied International Holdings Ltd and RJP Electronics Ltd was suspended on Thursday at the request of the companies pending an announcement, the Hong Kong stock exchange said.</p>
<p>Applied International said last month it was in preliminary negotiations with a third party regarding the possible sale of its 41.84 percent stake in RJP Electronics.</p>
<p>Applied International shares closed at HK$0.78 on Wednesday and RJP Electronics at HK$0.64.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6345</p>
